===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|pathology}} A serious [[infectious]] disease leading to [[inflammation]] of mucous membranes of the upper [[respiratory tract]], caused by {{taxlink|Corynebacterium diphtheriae|species|noshow=1}}.
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2019|author=[[w:Bill Bryson|Bill Bryson]]|title=The Body: A Guide for Occupants|publisher=Black Swan (2020)|page=377|passage=Today '''diphtheria''' has become so rare — just five cases in the United States in the most recent decade measured — that many doctors would struggle to recognize it.}}

